<given-names>TE</given-names></name><name><surname>Rampacek</surname><given-names>GB</given-names></name><name><surname>Kraeling</surname><given-names>RR</given-names></name><name><surname>Thompson</surname><given-names>FN</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effect of suckling on cortisol, progesterone and luteinizing hormone in postpartum beef cows</article-title><source>Theriogenology</source><year>1981</year><volume>16</volume><fpage>185</fpage><lpage>193</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16725631</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/0093-691X(81)90100-X</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dobson</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Smith</surname><given-names>RF</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>What is stress, and how does it affect reproduction?</article-title><source>Anim Reprod Sci</source><year>2000</year><volume>60&#x02013;61</volume><fpage>743</fpage><lpage>752</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0378-4320(00)00080-4</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dunlap</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name><name><surname>Kiser</surname><given-names>TE</given-names></name><name><surname>Cox</surname><given-names>NM</given-names></name><name><surname>Thompson</surname><given-names>FN</given-names></name><name><surname>Rampacek</surname><given-names>GB</given-names></name><name><surname>Benyshek</surname><given-names>LL</given-names></name><name><surname>Kraeling</surname><given-names>RR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cortisol and luteinizing hormone after adrenocorticotropic hormone administration to postpartum beef cows</article-title><source>J Anim Sci</source><year>1981</year><volume>52</volume><fpage>587</fpage><lpage>593</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6267002</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Leining</surname><given-names>KB</given-names></name><name><surname>Tucker</surname><given-names>HA</given-names></name><name><surname>Kesner</surname><given-names>JS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Growth hormone, glucocorticoids and thyroxine response to duration, intensity and wavelength of light in prepubertal bulls</article-title><source>J Anim Sci</source><year>1980</year><volume>51</volume><fpage>932</fpage><lpage>942</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7462118</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>